      ],
      "simplifications": "Primary sources checked2026-11-12: LPIC-1 objectives5.0/109.1, RFC792 and RFC1122 Echo, RFC9293 normal TCP opening, RFC768 UDP and Cisco IOS XE17 policy grammar. Existing in-process route/ACL model and finite transport reducers only. IPv4 unicast Echo types8/0 with code0, fixed identifier/sequence and reflected bounded binary bytes. No wire checksum serialization, ICMP errors, IPv6/ICMPv6, TTL/latency, timers, retries, sockets, Linux ping or host command execution. ACL matches all protocol1 traffic; it does not implement ICMP type filtering. Supplied application data is opaque, not HTTP/TLS interoperability. No Linux firewall or full IOS operating-system claim.",
